	(text "USB 2.0 self-powered hub: individual 500mA port switches and fault feedback.\nCFG[1:0]=00, all ports removable. No EEPROM required.\nVBUS_DET and upstream OE follow the selected host via MCU firmware.\nOne 100nF at each hub supply pin; 18pF crystal loads require prototype verification."
